homelab-audit (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: system-wide audit trail consumer. Producers
    enqueue into audit.queue via a local, synchronous Postgres INSERT
    (Homelab::Common::AuditClient, homelab-common 0.1.14+); this
    service drains it into the normalized, partitioned audit.entries
    fact table and serves the audit.view-gated query endpoint.

